{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"feel\": \"起初有一种突然被触动的激动，郑重而略带不安；随后渐渐柔和下来，生出温柔的期待，却仍有一点悬而未决的感觉，并不真正安心。\",\n  \"thread\": \"有件事忽然变得很重要，重要到还来不及弄清它究竟意味着什么，心就已经被牵动了。可是，真切地动了心，并不等于已经得到了什么。最初那阵强烈的激动过去以后，在意并没有消失，只是变成了更小心的期待：想要亲近，却还不知道这份心意能否得到回应。\",\n  \"used\": \"无\",\n  \"new\": [\n    \"已经有了一份真切而强烈的在意，但它指向的满足尚未到来，甚至还没有被完全认清。\",\n    \"这份在意既使人愿意靠近，也使人无法完全安心。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": \"无\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4a3a2faf-4ee8-470d-ab35-21455795e9f6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T223852758420Z", "elapsed_seconds": 84.047, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:40:16.818083+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "398c266d7c6ec192b8449a71e283650b163a29c86d88185c81697061c87e2dc4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {